(FACTORYFLOW - SYSTEM DESIGN NOTE \\(PAGE 1 OF 2\\)) Tj
T* (====================================================================================) Tj
T* (1. ARCHITECTURE & TECH STACK) Tj
T* (   React 18 + TypeScript + Tailwind + Vite 6 PWA <-> FastAPI + SQLAlchemy 2 + PG) Tj
T* (   IndexedDB + Service Worker \\(sw.js\\) offline queue -> /api/v1/orders/sync) Tj
T* (   Decimal + PostgreSQL NUMERIC arithmetic across GST, costing, ledger & ageing.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. CORE ENTITY RELATIONSHIPS) Tj
T* (   USERS -> SALES_ORDERS -> INVOICES \\(1:1 immutable\\) & DISPATCHES \\(1:1\\)) Tj
T* (   PRODUCTS -> BOM_HEADERS \\(versioned\\) -> BOM_LINES -> STOCK_ITEMS) Tj
T* (   PRODUCTION_RUNS \\(pins bom_id + bom_version_snapshot\\) -> MATERIALS / EXPENSES) Tj
T* (   STOCK_ITEMS -> STOCK_BALANCES \\(1:1 projection\\) & STOCK_LEDGER \\(append-only\\)) Tj
T* (   CUSTOMERS -> PAYMENTS -> PAYMENT_ALLOCATIONS -> INVOICES) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. APPEND-ONLY STOCK LEDGER & WEIGHTED-AVERAGE VALUATION) Tj
T* (   StockLedger enforces SQLAlchemy before_update / before_delete hooks.) Tj
T* (   Mistakes emit traceable REVERSAL movements linked to source document IDs.) Tj
T* (   Weighted Avg Rate = \\(Old Value + Receipt Value\\) / \\(Old Qty + Receipt Qty\\).) Tj
T* (   Benchmark Flour: \\(100 kg * 42 + 60 kg * 45\\) / 160 kg = Rs 43.125/kg \\(Rs 6,900\\).) Tj
T* (   Historical balances \\(as_of_date\\) replay StockLedger rows <= cutoff_dt.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. BOM CONSUMPTION & PRODUCTION VARIANCE) Tj
T* (   Runs scale BOM lines & snapshot exact version so future BOM edits stay isolated.) Tj
T* (   Consumed qty = actual_qty + damaged_qty \\(188 good + 6 damaged = 194 pouches\\).) Tj
T* (   Variance % = \\(\\(Actual - Planned\\) / Planned\\) * 100 against 3% tolerance:) Tj
T* (   GREEN \\(<2.25%\\), ORANGE \\(2.25%..3.00%\\), RED \\(>3.00% exceeding tolerance\\).) Tj
T* (   Benchmark Run: Yield -6% \\(188/200\\), Oil +5%, Pouches -3%, Cartons -10% \\(8 unpacked\\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (====================================================================================) Tj
T* (Page 1 of 2 - FactoryFlow Architecture & Ledger Design) Tj
ET
endstream
