(FACTORYFLOW - SYSTEM DESIGN NOTE \\(PAGE 2 OF 2\\)) Tj
T* (====================================================================================) Tj
T* (5. PRODUCTION COSTING FORMULA) Tj
T* (   Material & Pkg Cost reads StockLedger PRODUCTION_ISSUE \\(actual, not planned\\):) Tj
T* (   Flour 1,725 + Oil 1,470 + Spice 240 + Pouches 485 + Cartons 135 = Rs 4,055.00.) Tj
T* (   Overheads \\(posted ProductionExpense\\): Labour Rs 1,200 + Gas Rs 600 = Rs 1,800.00.) Tj
T* (   Total Run Cost = Rs 5,855.00 / 188 good packets = Rs 31.143617 \\(Display Rs 31.14\\).) Tj
T* (   Pre-GST Unit Profit = Rs 50.00 - Rs 31.143617 = Rs 18.86 \\(Gross Margin 37.71%\\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6. STATE-AWARE GST CALCULATION & DISPATCH ISOLATION) Tj
T* (   Compares factory state \\(Tamil Nadu, 33\\) against customer Place of Supply:) Tj
T* (   Intra-state splits GST equally: Retailer A 150*50 = 7,500 + CGST 187.50 + SGST 187.50.) Tj
T* (   Inter-state applies IGST: Distributor B \\(KA\\) 120*50 = 6,000 + IGST 300 = 6,300.) Tj
T* (   Shortage Check locks StockBalance FOR UPDATE: holds AWAITING_STOCK \\(shortage 32\\).) Tj
T* (   Dispatches atomically deduct StockLedger SALES_DISPATCH \\(238 - 150 = 88 FG\\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (7. PAYMENT ALLOCATION & RECEIVABLES AGEING) Tj
T* (   PaymentAllocation enforces unique \\(payment_id, invoice_id\\) preventing double count.) Tj
T* (   Outstanding = Invoice Total - Posted Allocations - CreditNotes \\(7,875 - 4,000 = 3,875\\).) Tj
T* (   Ageing buckets: Current, 1-30d, 31-60d, 61-90d, >90d overdue.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8. AUDIT TRAIL & OFFLINE PWA IDEMPOTENCY) Tj
T* (   AuditLogs trace actor, role, action, resource_id & IP \\(no DELETE endpoint\\).) Tj
T* (   Offline PWA queues orders in IndexedDB; /orders/sync enforces unique idempotency_key,) Tj
T* (   preserves submitted_unit_price, flags price drift NEEDS_REVIEW, submits as SUBMITTED.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (====================================================================================) Tj
T* (Page 2 of 2 - FactoryFlow Costing, GST, Payments & Audit Design) Tj
